{
  "movie_id": 505800301,
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 7.0,
      "end_time": 11.4,
      "text": "When I'd first arrived, I could carry\neverything I had over my shoulder..."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 13.0,
      "end_time": 16.8,
      "text": "Before I knew it, I'd built up so many\nthings..."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 22.8,
      "end_time": 24.2,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 28.0,
      "end_time": 29.2,
      "text": "Whew."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 53.0,
      "end_time": 55.0,
      "text": "My lord..."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 75.0,
      "end_time": 76.6,
      "text": "My Lord"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 76.8,
      "end_time": 78.8,
      "text": "Make sure you be careful with your health"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 79.0,
      "end_time": 82.2,
      "text": "so you don't catch a cold."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 85.2,
      "end_time": 88.8,
      "text": "And make sure you aren't so picky with your\nfood."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 89.0,
      "end_time": 92.0,
      "text": "And sleep well, move plenty..."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 92.8,
      "end_time": 96.8,
      "text": "So that you can live on everyday, perfectly\nhealthy."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 98.6,
      "end_time": 103.0,
      "text": "Make sure you brush your teeth every day."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 104.4,
      "end_time": 110.0,
      "text": "Umm... And... Kokkoro will..."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 111.0,
      "end_time": 114.0,
      "text": "Kokkoro will always..."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 115.0,
      "end_time": 120.0,
      "text": "Always... Be wishing for your happiness."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 122.0,
      "end_time": 126.4,
      "text": "Even if you end up forgetting all about me."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 127.0,
      "end_time": 130.0,
      "text": "Forever... and ever..."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 137.0,
      "end_time": 143.0,
      "text": "My Lord, I'm grateful for everything you have\ndone for me."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 154.8,
      "end_time": 157.8,
      "text": "Kokkoro was..."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 158.4,
      "end_time": 161.0,
      "text": "So very happy."
    }
  ],
